<title>UK: Whitbread rises as Natwest repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Whitbread rises as Natwest repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK brewer Whitbread rose to a new record after Natwest reiterated its &quot;add&quot; recommendation.</p>
<p>By 1602 GMT, the shares were up 11p to 766-1/2p after having climbed as high as 770p earlier.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
